Nike announced the race would take place at the [Monza Circuit](link_25) near [Monza](link_24), Italy, where Kipchoge ran a half marathon personal best of 59:17 during a test event.[[10]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ineos_1:59_Challenge#cite_note-10) The course was 2.4 kilometres (1.5 mi) long which meant the run would consist of about 17.5 laps around the course.[[11]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ineos_1:59_Challenge#cite_note-Wired2-11)

